{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2021-11-19 18:12:00', 'title': 'HII AWARDED ADDITIONAL $113.6 MILLION ADVANCE PROCUREMENT CONTRACT FOR AMPHIBIOUS ASSAULT SHIP LHA 9', 'text': 'PASCAGOULA, MISS., NOV. 19, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES (NYSE:HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION HAS RECEIVED A CONTRACT MODIFICATION FROM THE U.S. NAVY FOR $113.6 MILLION TO ENABLE LONG-LEAD-TIME MATERIAL AND ADVANCE PROCUREMENT ACTIVITIES FOR AMPHIBIOUS ASSAULT SHIP LHA 9. THIS MODIFICATION BRINGS THE TOTAL ADVANCE FUNDING FOR LHA 9 TO $651 MILLION.'}